key "None of these products is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575694}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e01af3ae-fb4a-5e38-8b42-8320c8e0b105" :question/problem "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 9 \\\\ -7 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$S=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -6 & -9 & -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $P,R,$ and $S?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Notice that $P$ is a $3\\times 2$ matrix, $R$ is a $1\\times 2$ row vector, and $S$ is a $1\\times 5$ row vector. \n\nThere are $5$ columns in $S$ and $3$ rows in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $S$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $S$ and $P$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{S}_{1\\times 5}{\\times }_{\\ne }{P}_{3\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $P$ and $1$ row in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $P$ and $S$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{3\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{S}_{1\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $2$ columns in $R$ and $1$ row in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $R$ and $S$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{S}_{1\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nThe products $SP$, $PS$, and $RS$ are undefined. Select “None of these products is well defined.”" :task-item/_content [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186574920 :task-item/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562914} :task-item/elapsed-seconds 30.291999999999998 :task-item/id #uuid "8164235f-31bd-4459-ae9