ed\">\n<div>$F=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$H=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- $F$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It is square, but an entry off the main diagonal is nonzero: ${f}_{12}=7\\ne 0$.\n\n- $H$ is a diagonal matrix. It is square and every off-diagonal entry is zero. It is also an identity matrix; identity matrices are diagonal matrices.\n\n- $M$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It is square, but an entry off the main diagonal is nonzero: ${m}_{14}=1\\ne 0$.\n\nTherefore, only $H$ is a diagonal matrix."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186568960 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087697 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "09fa0899-a3d2-584f-8cdd-a471f8cfd16b" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Special Square Matrix" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048252 :topic/id #uuid "8c876864-a853-56d6-a887-91d7f8f1cf14" :topic/math-academy-id 862 :topic/title "Zero, Square, Diagonal and Identity Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9557f504-828b-5db3-8d32-ce0c025e5fd2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568997} {:answer/id #uuid "c4818e4b-a7d7-5631-8820-4ef1631ce283" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569026}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9557f504-828b-5db3-8d32-ce0c025e5fd2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568997} :answer-field/id #uuid "67d6b16c-fb26-5e65-a790-7d5ff21e79ac" :answer-field/key "H" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-fie