 -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$H=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- $F$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It is square, but an entry off the main diagonal is nonzero: ${f}_{31}=-1\\ne 0$.\n\n- $H$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It is not a square matrix: it has 4 rows and 3 columns.\n\n- $M$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It is not a square matrix: it has 3 rows and 2 columns.\n\nTherefore, none of the given matrices are diagonal matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186568974 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087697 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "09fa0899-a3d2-584f-8cdd-a471f8cfd16b" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Special Square Matrix" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048252 :topic/id #uuid "8c876864-a853-56d6-a887-91d7f8f1cf14" :topic/math-academy-id 862 :topic/title "Zero, Square, Diagonal and Identity Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9bd7d80c-bb55-540d-b020-5c9a32822b03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569001} {:answer/id #uuid "cd48151c-ae5d-55b4-83a9-7a42f573248e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569035}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9bd7d80c-bb55-540d-b020-5c9a32822b03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569001} :answer-field/id #uuid "0cf44860-4b14-5f92-9f07-f6d85d0eaabe" :answer-field/key "M" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568906} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "123b9471-614c-513b-84cb-0c658ceded7c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 175