d{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- $M$ is an identity matrix. It is square, every main diagonal entry is one, and every off-diagonal entry is zero.\n\n- $N$ is *not* an identity matrix. It is not a square matrix: it has 3 rows and 2 columns.\n\n- $P$ is an identity matrix. It is square, every main diagonal entry is one, and every off-diagonal entry is zero.\n\nTherefore, only $M$ and $P$ are identity matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186568986 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087697 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "09fa0899-a3d2-584f-8cdd-a471f8cfd16b" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Special Square Matrix" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048252 :topic/id #uuid "8c876864-a853-56d6-a887-91d7f8f1cf14" :topic/math-academy-id 862 :topic/title "Zero, Square, Diagonal and Identity Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "70649921-6c74-5be4-9f8f-3944f8211e70" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568972} {:answer/id #uuid "7fc8c700-1f42-5e86-b162-01b17bcfdd41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568983}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7fc8c700-1f42-5e86-b162-01b17bcfdd41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568983} :answer-field/id #uuid "0d8afe45-a0fc-588c-a513-6d771bb0a9a7" :answer-field/key "P" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568907} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7782f5a0-a1c4-58ee-8b81-e5f9c2c14be2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568977} {:answer/id #uuid "8ade7729-b2a4-5f2a-980a-0374b9c18f8b" :answer/type {:db