6576353} :answer-field/id #uuid "cb1bdca5-4ce0-599f-a4ef-e86e1507d8a7" :answer-field/key "$D$ is lower triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576352}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5fc95051-8b70-5447-aece-290d3854c40e" :question/math-academy-id "q-126481" :question/problem "Consider the matrix\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- $D$ is upper triangular: **False.** This fails because $D$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $D$ is lower triangular: **True.** All the entries above the main diagonal of $D$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- ${D}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **True.** All the entries below the main diagonal of ${D}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{D}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe true statements are:\n\n- $D$ is lower triangular.\n- ${D}^{T}$ is upper triangular."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186571420 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050283 :topic/id #uuid "3cb2a10b-5d06-5efe-b222-3c14b0ccd7c8" :topic/math-academy-id 1777 :topic/title "Triangular Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f5e3104-7cbb-553b-a0d4-b02d61cb8874" :answ